body:
`WorkspaceSwitcher.onWorkspaceChange` in `HomeTopNav` hardcoded the post-switch redirect to `${origin}/console/home`. That works behind `HonoServerPlugin` (mounted at `/console/`), but on Vercel — where `vercel.json` builds with `VITE_BASE_PATH=/` and the SPA is served at root — switching workspaces lands on a 404.

### Changes
- **`apps/console/src/pages/home/HomeTopNav.tsx`**: derive the redirect target from `import.meta.env.BASE_URL` (the value passed to Vite's `base`), so it resolves to `/console/home` for the bundled server and `/home` on standalone deployments.
- **`.changeset/fix-console-workspace-redirect.md`**: patch-level changeset for `@object-ui/console`.

```ts
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/';
const normalizedBase = base.endsWith('/') ? base : `${base}/`;
window.location.href = `${window.location.origin}${normalizedBase}home`;
```

No other call sites hardcode `/console/` in the console app (verified via grep).
